  "contentHtml": "<p>아래 글에 6차시까지 있구요.</p><p>이어서 7~12까지 올립니다. 저는 이렇게 하면 아이들 졸업 때까지</p><p>5차시 남는데ㅜㅜ 재과만 카페에서 얻어가서 나머지 5차시를 채우려구요.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>고1 통합과학 책 살펴보고 중학교 내용을 맞추어 만든 워크시트입니다.</p><p>생각보다 많은 선생님들에게 도움이 되는 거 같아 기쁜 마음으로 자료 공유합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.liveworksheets.com/em1454371nx\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.liveworksheets.com/em1454371nx</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"이온화합물 worksheet\" data-og-description=\"물질 online worksheet for 3/예비고1. You can do the exercises online or download the worksheet as pdf.\" data-og-host=\"www.liveworksheets.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://www.liveworksheets.com/em1454371nx\" data-og-url=\"https://www.liveworksheets.com/em1454371nx\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/b2ycyN/hyIGoa1GNf/XypHq02szBsE2zQRliZ2Y0/img.jpg?width=1000&amp;height=1418&amp;face=0_0_1000_1418\"><a href=\"https://www.liveworksheets.com/em1454371nx\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://www.liveworksheets.com/em1454371nx\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/b2ycyN/hyIGoa1GNf/XypHq02szBsE2zQRliZ2Y0/img.jpg?width=1000&amp;height=1418&amp;face=0_0_1000_1418)\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">이온화합물 worksheet</p><p class=\"og-desc\">물질 online worksheet for 3/예비고1. You can do the exercises online or download the worksheet as pdf.</p><p class=\"og-host\">www.liveworksheets.com</p></div></a></div><p><a href=\"https://www.liveworksheets.com/gf1458195mt\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.liveworksheets.com/gf1458195mt</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"열공뮤직복습(이온,분자) worksheet\" data-og-description=\"물질 online worksheet for 3/예비고1. You can do the exercise